shzx-timestral uses candle-timestral and Candle as external dependencies.

The categorical preprocessing follows the Apache-2.0 reference implementation
by Mistral AI: https://github.com/mistralai/timestral

The reference test fixtures and adapted parity cases are from the Apache-2.0
nfnt/datafusion-forecast project. See tests/fixtures/README.md and its retained
LICENSE-APACHE-2.0 for provenance and attribution.

Model weights are not included in this crate. Their separate Modified MIT
license is downloaded alongside the checkpoints and is not replaced by this
code license.
